      <div type="clause" n="Prol.">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IXAtr">IX Atr</ref> Prol.</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">(Incip.) [Wanley] Ðis is seo gerædnes þe Æþelred cyning and ealle his witan æt Wudestoce geræddan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">This is the ordinance which King Æthelred and all his councillors have determined upon at Woodstock.</ab>
